msgid "Start"
msgstr "Comenzar"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/quickstart.md:23
#: cccd63ebc90342a49320e8de40ec67cb
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verificar"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/quickstart.md:29
#: 87af5daf8c3c4cdfae4b302aa084abf3
msgid "Human acceptance"
msgstr "Aceptacion humana"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/quickstart.md:31
#: 01e363e60b4041e385189f5fbd5ced9a
msgid ""
"Inspect the output, logs, test results, and diff. Accept, request a "
"correction, quarantine, or stop; do not silently promote a generated result."
msgstr ""
"Inspeccione la salida, los registros, los resultados de pruebas y el diff. "
"Acepte, solicite una correccion, ponga en cuarentena o detengase; no "
"promueva silenciosamente un resultado generado."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/quickstart.md:33
#: 4947da566ce349fd8b54b3fc52245f8f
msgid ""
"`npm test` includes the v1 compatibility and Mage v2 contract checks, "
"TypeScript, MkDocs, accessibility, browser behavior, and deterministic "
"1/25/100 replay gates. It does not substitute for live extension, identity, "
"Colab, or school acceptance."
msgstr ""
"`npm test` includes the v1 compatibility and Mage v2 contract checks, "
"TypeScript, MkDocs, accessibility, browser behavior, and deterministic "
"1/25/100 replay gates. It does not substitute for live extension, identity, "
"Colab, or school acceptance."
